{\b OpenXR Gaze Overlay \emdash  unofficial community build}\par
\par
This package shows stream viewers where you are looking in VR, by drawing a ring on your OBS mirror image. The ring is never visible in the headset.\par
\par
It installs modified builds of two open-source OpenXR API layers, plus an unmodified OBS plugin:\par
\par
\bullet  {\b Quad-Views-Foveated} by Matthieu Bucchianeri (MIT licence). Change: it also publishes where your eyes are looking.\par
\bullet  {\b OpenXR-Layer-OBSMirror} by Jabbah (MIT licence). Changes: it draws the gaze ring on the mirror image, and fixes a texture leak.\par
\bullet  The OBS plugin (win-openxr) from OpenXR-Layer-OBSMirror, unmodified.\par
\par
{\b These are not the original authors' releases.} They did not build, test or endorse this package. Please do not ask them for support with it.\par
\par
This package is not code-signed. Games that use anti-cheat software may refuse to load the layers.\par
\par
The full licence texts and third-party notices are installed next to each layer (LICENSE.txt and THIRD_PARTY.txt).\par
